digital solution central database is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/test#DigitalSolution_CentralDatabase".

digital solution central database has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

digital solution central database has the type "dcterms:Software".

digital solution central database has the preferred label "Central Database Solution".

digital solution central database is in the scheme digital dimension scheme.

digital solution central database has the explanation "Central database for simultaneous information sharing amongst authorities involved in the designation and registration process".

digital solution central database has the broader concept digital solutions.

digital solution central database has the title "Central database".

digital solution central database has the comment "Central database for simultaneous information sharing amongst authorities involved in the designation and registration process. Uses existing infrastructure for accessibility and reusability.".

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasReference" the value "Article 26".

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasFunctionality" the value "Simultaneous information sharing".

digital solution central database has the capability "Simultaneous information sharing amongst authorities involved in the designation and registration process".

digital solution central database is published by agent esma.

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasResponsibleBody" the resource agent esma.

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasAccessibilityMeasure" the value "ESMA, EBA (in close cooperation with the ESCB) shall develop draft implementing technical standards to specify the uniform electronic formats to be submitted to the central database.".

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasReusabilityMeasure" the value "Data provided to the central database under this Regulation is made available to relevant competent authorities if relevant or necessary for the performance of their duties under Regulations (EU) No 648/2012 and Regulation (EU) No 909/2014.".

digital solution central database has for "lomo:hasPolicyCompliance" the value "Compliance with the EU Cybersecurity framework will be ensured through the implementation of technical standards and specifications, which will be established by ESMA and EBA in close collaboration with ESCB.".


