digital public service designation registration platform is a public service.

digital public service designation registration platform has the title "Platform for applications for designation of a system and third-country systems registration".

digital public service designation registration platform has the description "Provide central entry point for applications in an electronic format for designation of a system. Provide central entry point for application for registration of third-country systems. Platform for processing and sharing the data amongst authorities involved in the designation and registration process.".


implementation measure central database is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/test#ImplementationMeasure_CentralDatabase".

implementation measure central database has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

implementation measure central database is a concept.

implementation measure central database has the preferred label "Central Database Establishment".

implementation measure central database is in the scheme digital dimension scheme.

implementation measure central database has the explanation "ESMA shall establish a central database".

implementation measure central database has for "lomo:hasReference" the value "Article 26".

implementation measure central database has for "lomo:hasResponsibleBody" the resource agent esma.

implementation measure central database has for "lomo:hasTimeline" the value "Immediate implementation".


implementation measure technical standards is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/test#ImplementationMeasure_TechnicalStandards".

implementation measure technical standards has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

implementation measure technical standards is a concept.

implementation measure technical standards has the preferred label "Technical Standards Development".

implementation measure technical standards is in the scheme digital dimension scheme.

implementation measure technical standards has the explanation "ESMA, EBA (in close cooperation with the ESCB) shall develop draft implementing technical standards to specify the uniform electronic formats to be submitted to the central database".

implementation measure technical standards has for "lomo:hasReference" the value "Article 13(13), Article 13(15)".

implementation measure technical standards has for "lomo:hasResponsibleBody" the resource agent esma.

implementation measure technical standards has for "lomo:hasResponsibleBody" the resource agent eba.

implementation measure technical standards has for "lomo:hasTimeline" the value "One year after entry into force".

implementation measure technical standards has for "lomo:hasCommissionRole" the value "Delegated acts adoption".


